{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナンバリング間違えてたね\nご指摘ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は13th初全握でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、話したい誰かがいる\n嫉妬の権利\n-MC-\n隙間\n大人への近道\n-MC-\nポピパッパパー\n-MC-\n悲しみの忘れ方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、中田は久々に3曲も歌ってます！！\n改めて本当に嬉しいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n愛未と未央奈のいない嫉妬の権利\n未央奈のいない大人への近道\nでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はみんなで披露したいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ全国ツアーが\n3/19 名古屋から始まるということ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n3/20がらりんの乃木坂としての最後のステージということ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が発表されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな来てね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん中田レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん ぶれてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみなさん\n本当にありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近知って驚いた事ある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2016年の目標は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前もって言いますが\n明日はサンタコスじゃありません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"計画性がなくて\n買いに行ける時間が無かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にごめんなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその後は\nらじらー！です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/26/3665547/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph